# Starter feedback

A defect in shared starter behavior gets fixed in the starter, then in the derived app. Shared behavior means theme, tab bar, `components/ui`, premade blocks, i18n plumbing, auth and billing shell, swarm, and security helpers.

- If this workspace is the starter, fix it here and add a row to `STARTER-FEEDBACK.md`.
- If this workspace is a clone, apply the same fix in `~/Developer/create-filip-app` when that checkout exists, add the row there, and keep the clone in sync.
- Product-only screens, names, and copy stay in the derived app.
- Do not record a workaround that leaves the starter broken.
